==Battleground==
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is a requirement to drain as much of Dread Bore's HP as possible before D.D.D unburrows, as the two becomes a nightmare of a combo. Once Dread Bore is dead and waiting to revive, use your spammable attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]] to quickly drain D.D.D's hp. Then, round 2 with a weakened Dread Bore, and then the D.D.D. again. Once those two are truly dead, the stage is over. If you have Holy Cannon, this is absolutely the stage to use it on, as it will make the stage much easier to handle.

